---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Media Kit & Partnership Dossier 2026" 
  description="Official media kit, audience demographics, editorial standards, and sponsorship tiers for HeliaTech Media."
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-16">
    <!-- Top Pill -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-fuchsia-500/30 text-fuchsia-300 text-xs font-mono mb-8 shadow-glow-fuchsia">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span>OFFICIAL MEDIA KIT • 2026 EDITION</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Title & Hero -->
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
      The Software & AI <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-fuchsia-400">
        Intelligence Media Kit.
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <strong>HeliaTech Media</strong> (<a href="https://heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400 underline">heliatech.online</a>) is the independent technological observatory delivering forensic software benchmarks, hands-on masterclasses, and executive buying intelligence for modern enterprises.
    </p>

    <!-- Key Metrics Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-cyan-500/30 text-center shadow-glow-cyan">
        <span class="block text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white font-mono mb-1">42+</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Forensic Assets</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white font-mono mb-1">100K</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Monthly Visitor Target</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-fuchsia-500/30 text-center shadow-glow-fuchsia">
        <span class="block text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white font-mono mb-1">85%+</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-fuchsia-300 uppercase tracking-wider">US & EU Audience</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white font-mono mb-1">100%</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">High-Intent B2B</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Audience Demographics -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 mb-4 font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>✦ AUDIENCE & DECISION-MAKER PROFILES</span>
        <span class="h-[1px] flex-grow bg-slate-800"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-2xl mb-3 block">👔</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">C-Suite & Founders (40%)</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            CEOs, CTOs, and technical founders evaluating tooling to replace legacy SaaS subscriptions and accelerate company velocity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-2xl mb-3 block">⚡</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Engineering & Ops Leads (35%)</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            VPs of Engineering, Systems Architects, and RevOps managers executing hands-on integration workshops.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-2xl mb-3 block">🚀</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Growth & Media Teams (25%)</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Content creators, marketing executives, and growth operators deploying generative audio, video, and automation suites.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Core Coverage Verticals -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 mb-4 font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>✦ EDITORIAL SPECIALIZATIONS</span>
        <span class="h-[1px] flex-grow bg-slate-800"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          <span class="text-slate-200">Generative AI & Audio / Voice Synthesis</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-400"></span>
          <span class="text-slate-200">Workflow Automation & Visual No-Code Pipelines</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-400"></span>
          <span class="text-slate-200">AI Code Editors & Developer Engineering Velocity</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span class="text-slate-200">B2B Outbound Infrastructure & Lead Enrichment</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Partnership Opportunities -->
    <section class="mb-16 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-cyan-500/30 shadow-glow-cyan relative overflow-hidden">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">Partnership & Syndication Formats</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
        We collaborate with world-class SaaS organizations, developer platform creators, and affiliate networks to deliver verified, high-converting technical deep dives.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">▹</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-white">Flagship Teardown Sponsorship:</strong> A permanent, forensic audit covering your software's architecture, ROI calculus, and feature matrix.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">▹</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-white">Hands-on Masterclass & Workshop:</strong> Step-by-step practical implementation guides featuring Mermaid workflow diagrams.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">▹</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-white">Multi-Channel Social Syndication:</strong> Custom 4-tweet viral threads on X and executive authority breakdowns on LinkedIn.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">▹</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-white">Verified Affiliate Partner Placement:</strong> Cloaked 0ms edge redirection (<code class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">/go/[tool]</code>) with dedicated callout badges.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact & Brand Verification -->
    <section class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-3">Initiate a Partnership Dialogue</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-md mx-auto mb-6">
        Ready to introduce your software to modern tech buyers? Connect directly with our editorial and partnerships desk.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="mailto:contact.heliatech@gmail.com" 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-fuchsia-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-sm tracking-wide shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"
      >
        <span>Contact Partnerships: contact.heliatech@gmail.com</span>
        <span>➔</span>
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
